From: Aspartame GTK4 migration
Subject: [PATCH] gtk4: explicitly select the Journal stack child

GTK4 can receive ShowJournal while the model is already in Activity zoom. In
that case no zoom-level signal is emitted, leaving the stack on an empty
surface. Select the registered Journal child explicitly after activation.

--- a/src/jarabe/view/service.py
+++ b/src/jarabe/view/service.py
@@ -107,6 +107,7 @@
         model._set_active_activity(model.get_activity_by_id(
             journal.activity_id))
         model.set_zoom_level(model.ZOOM_ACTIVITY)
+        model.stack.set_visible_child_name("journal")
         return True
